1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:09,596
Speaking, task four. Situation number 10. The examiner describes a situation. Agree with her, choose one option and say why.

2
00:00:10,300 --> 00:00:17,454
Our friend is celebrating her birthday. Where shall we have the party? Any ideas? You can choose from these options.

3
00:00:26,167 --> 00:00:27,870
We could have the party at home.

4
00:00:28,167 --> 00:00:29,748
There isn't much room at home.

5
00:00:30,033 --> 00:00:31,767
Then let's have the party in the park.

6
00:00:32,067 --> 00:00:33,430
It will be cold in the park.

7
00:00:33,733 --> 00:00:35,617
Then let's have the party in a restaurant.

8
00:00:35,933 --> 00:00:37,186
And why there?

9
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:39,663
Because we won't have to cook or clean up there.

10
00:00:39,967 --> 00:00:43,753
OK, that's a good idea. The party will be at the restaurant.

11
00:00:44,067 --> 00:00:53,307
Practise situation 10 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website. The link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
